## Struttura monorepo

```
docheck/
├── blueprint/                  # Spec tecniche enterprise (intent, history-of-record)
├── docheck-engine/             # Backend Python (FastAPI + LangGraph + vLLM/Ollama)
│   ├── src/docheck/
│   │   ├── api/                # HTTP/WS routes, RBAC deps, middleware
│   │   ├── agents/             # LangGraph agents (classifier, legal, technical, pii, synth)
│   │   ├── core/               # config, JWT, OIDC, security, tenant, telemetry
│   │   ├── db/                 # SQLAlchemy models, migrate, RLS, session
│   │   ├── schemas/            # Pydantic Finding, CheckState
│   │   └── services/           # parser, audit, llm, embedding, vectorstores, signing
│   ├── alembic/                # DB migrations
│   └── tests/                  # unit + integration + E2E
├── docheck-ui/                 # Frontend (Next.js 15 + React 19 + Electron + shadcn/ui)
│   ├── app/                    # routes (login, scan, documents, policies, audit, settings)
│   ├── components/             # findings, viewer, policy, audit, scan, reasoning, ui
│   ├── electron/               # Electron shell (preload sandboxed)
│   └── lib/                    # API client, hooks, stores
├── docheck-shared-schemas/     # JSON Schema condivisi FE/BE (Finding contract)
├── docker/                     # compose files + helm chart
├── scripts/                    # seed, mock LLM, KPI eval, file-LOC check
├── storage/                    # runtime: docs/, chroma/, sqlite, audit key
└── docs/                       # documentazione (Diátaxis)
```

---

## Stack

**Backend** Python 3.12 · FastAPI · LangGraph · SQLAlchemy 2 async · SQLCipher (single-tenant) / Postgres+RLS (multi-tenant) · PyNaCl Ed25519 · structlog · OpenTelemetry locale.
**LLM** vLLM (`Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct Q4_K_M` su DGX Spark) · Ollama (dev) · Mock server (test).
**Embedding** BGE-M3 multilingue. **Vector** ChromaDB (MVP) → Qdrant (multi-tenant). **OCR** PaddleOCR + Tesseract fallback.
**Frontend** Next.js 15 · React 19 · TypeScript strict · Tailwind · shadcn/ui · TanStack Query · Zustand · react-virtuoso · Electron 33.
**Crypto** Ed25519 (audit chain + report signing). **Trasporto FE↔BE** Unix socket (default) o TCP loopback (dev).

Cambio stack → ADR obbligatorio ([docs/adr/](docs/adr/)).

---

## KPI MVP

- **Precisione findings** ≥ 0.85 su test set 50 contratti IT annotati.
- **Recall** ≥ 0.80.
- **Tempo analisi 20pp** < 90s P95 su DGX Spark.
- **Cache hit-ratio** ≥ 60% post warmup.
- **Egress packets** = 0 durante analisi (gate CI con tcpdump).
- **Glass-box coverage** = 100% finding con `evidence.bbox` + `policy_ref.excerpt`.

Procedura valutazione: [docs/runbooks/kpi-evaluation.md](docs/runbooks/kpi-evaluation.md).

---

## Deploy

| Target | Come |
|--------|------|
| Workstation MVP | Electron installer firmato (notarized macOS / signed Windows) |
| Server DGX single-tenant | `docker compose -f docker/compose.yml up -d` |
| Multi-tenant dev | `docker compose -f docker/compose.postgres.yml up -d` |
| Kubernetes on-prem | `helm install docheck ./docker/helm/docheck --set multiTenant.enabled=true` |
| Air-gapped | mirror locale wheel cache + pesi modelli — vedi [docs/runbooks/setup-dev.md](docs/runbooks/setup-dev.md) |

